<<declare $package_pickup_interaction_times = 0>>
<<if $package_pickup_interaction_times==0>>
 A locker for package pickups.
 You carefully check for any surprise packages, despite having not ordered anything.
 Despite your hopes and dreams, the box remains empty.
 <<set $package_pickup_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $package_pickup_interaction_times==1>>
 You stick your hand in again, surely if you try again there could be something.
 <<set $package_pickup_interaction_times = 2>>
<<else>>
 The locker is empty.
<<endif>>
